    "title": "Malaysian Minister for Human Development visits AKU",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "On Tuesday, October 21 2003, the Malaysian Minister for Human Development, His Excellency Datuk Dr. Fong Chon Onn, visited Aga Khan University, Stadium Road campus. He was accompanied by the Federal Minister for Labour, Manpower and Overseas Pakistan",
